e and consumption bases separate.","risk_prevented":"accounting-basis mixing"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_PROVISIONAL_FINAL_STATUS","handling":"Keep provisional, final and in-development status explicit.","risk_prevented":"false finality"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_REVISION_CORRECTION_STATUS","handling":"Retain corrections and revision history.","risk_prevented":"silent revision loss"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_GEOGRAPHY","handling":"Keep UK, GB, England and local-authority geography distinct.","risk_prevented":"geography substitution"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_SECTOR_BOUNDARY","handling":"Retain the exact statistical sector definition.","risk_prevented":"sector mixing"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_GAS_SCOPE","handling":"Retain CO2, CH4, N2O and total CO2e scope.","risk_prevented":"gas-species mixing"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_UNIT","handling":"Retain MtCO2e, percentages, vehicles, MW and other units.","risk_prevented":"unit substitution"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_STOCK_FLOW","handling":"Keep registrations, licensed stock, allocations and annual emissions distinct.","risk_prevented":"stock-flow mixing"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_ACTIVITY_EMISSIONS","handling":"Keep activity, energy use, installations and emissions distinct.","risk_prevented":"false emissions inference"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_MEASURED_MODELLED","handling":"Keep measured, reported, estimated, modelled and projected values distinct.","risk_prevented":"measurement inflation"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_TAILPIPE_LIFECYCLE","handling":"Do not treat zero tailpipe CO2 as lifecycle-zero emissions.","risk_prevented":"boundary inflation"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_ALLOCATION_EMISSIONS","handling":"Keep ETS allowance allocation separate from verified emissions.","risk_prevented":"allowance-emissions conflation"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_THRESHOLD_CONTEXT","handling":"Apply regulatory thresholds only to their stated scheme context.","risk_prevented":"threshold misuse"},{"pattern_id":"PRESERVE_UNCERTAINTY","handling":"Retain uncerta